# Don & Leo, Problem Solvers: "At the beginning of your end step, exile up to one target artifact you control and up to one target creature you control. Then return
# them to the battlefield under their owners' control." On turn 3 Don & Leo enters (giving Bot1's EPF Point Squad a +1/+1 counter, a 3/2). At the end step the artifact
# slot refuses a creature that is not an artifact and Bot2's Mox Jet; the creature slot refuses the Mox. Mox Pearl (tapped for Don & Leo) and the Squad are exiled and
# return together as new objects (CR 400.7): the Mox untapped, the Squad without its counter (a 2/1).

